# TALK

TALK converts natural-language requests into safe Bash commands and executes them with a security gate before running.

## Features

- Natural language to shell command generation
- Risk analysis before command execution
- CLI and desktop GUI
- Safe execution with output streaming
- Local history and config persistence

## Quick start

```bash
python -m pip install -e .
talk --help
talk --gui
```

## Security note

This tool analyzes commands for destructive or dangerous patterns before execution. It is designed to reduce accidental shell risk, but users should still review commands carefully when using AI-generated shell actions.
